# This directory still holds the legacy OpenTofu module (main.tf etc.), removed in
# Phase 4 once the Crossplane path is proven live. Until then, keep every Terraform
# artifact out of the Fleet bundle — only the Crossplane managed-resource YAMLs here
# should ship (fleet apply reads from disk, so the gitignored terraform/ dir with the
# provider binary would otherwise be pulled in).
*.tf
.terraform.lock.hcl
.terraform/
terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.auto.tfvars.json
.gitignore
